---
title: Overview
order: 1
layout: dashboard.liquid
---
<h1>Overview</h1>

<p>One publisher sends through one relay to four subscribers, and every
connection was logged at both ends. <strong>All numbers on these pages are
dummy data</strong>, shaped like the real six-POP captures so the layout can be
judged.</p>

<dl class="stats wa-grid wa-gap-l">
  <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
    <dt class="wa-caption-m">Duration</dt>
    <dd class="wa-heading-xl">12 min 40 s</dd>
  </div>
  <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
    <dt class="wa-caption-m">Objects sent</dt>
    <dd class="wa-heading-xl">50,112</dd>
    <dd class="wa-caption-s">by the publisher</dd>
  </div>
  <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
    <dt class="wa-caption-m">Hops joined</dt>
    <dd class="wa-heading-xl">300,996</dd>
    <dd class="wa-caption-s">logged at both ends</dd>
  </div>
  <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
    <dt class="wa-caption-m">Held objects</dt>
    <dd class="wa-heading-xl">62–88</dd>
    <dd class="wa-caption-s">per subscriber, joined late</dd>
  </div>
</dl>

<div class="tray wa-grid wa-gap-xs">

  <section class="card wa-stack">
    <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-xs">
      <h2 class="wa-heading-m">End to end</h2>
      <wa-icon id="about-e2e" name="circle-info" label="About end to end" tabindex="0"></wa-icon>
      <wa-tooltip for="about-e2e">Mean time from the publisher creating an object to a subscriber parsing it, across all three legs.</wa-tooltip>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
      <span class="wa-heading-xl">216.3 ms</span>
      <span class="wa-caption-m">at sub-4, the slowest. sub-2 took 87.8 ms.</span>
    </div>
{% echart '150px', 'card' %}
{
  tooltip: { trigger: 'axis', axisPointer: { type: 'shadow' } },
  xAxis: { type: 'value' },
  yAxis: { type: 'category', data: ['sub-4', 'sub-3', 'sub-2', 'sub-1'] },
  // Last leg first: the one that varies sits on the baseline, where bars
  // compare directly, and takes the card's blue.
  series: [
    { name: 'relay -> sub', type: 'bar', stack: 'leg', data: [140.2, 88.1, 12.4, 55.8] },
    { name: 'relay dwell',  type: 'bar', stack: 'leg', data: [1.2, 3.1, 0.5, 1.9] },
    { name: 'pub -> relay', type: 'bar', stack: 'leg', data: [74.9, 75.0, 74.9, 74.9] },
  ],
}
{% endechart %}
    <div class="card-foot wa-split wa-caption-s">
      <span>Blue: relay to subscriber</span>
      <a href="latency/">Latency</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card wa-stack">
    <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-xs">
      <h2 class="wa-heading-m">Relay dwell</h2>
      <wa-icon id="about-dwell" name="circle-info" label="About relay dwell" tabindex="0"></wa-icon>
      <wa-tooltip for="about-dwell">Time an object spends inside the relay, from arriving to being sent on.</wa-tooltip>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
      <span class="wa-heading-xl">3.1 ms</span>
      <span class="wa-caption-m">mean at sub-3. Its median is 0.43 ms.</span>
    </div>
{% echart '150px', 'card' %}
{
  tooltip: { trigger: 'axis', axisPointer: { type: 'shadow' } },
  xAxis: { type: 'category', data: ['sub-1', 'sub-2', 'sub-3', 'sub-4'] },
  yAxis: { type: 'value' },
  series: [
    { name: 'mean',   type: 'bar', data: [1.9, 0.5, 3.1, 1.2] },
    { name: 'median', type: 'bar', data: [0.31, 0.26, 0.43, 0.29] },
  ],
}
{% endechart %}
    <div class="card-foot wa-split wa-caption-s">
      <span>Blue: mean. Gray: median.</span>
      <a href="latency/">Latency</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card wa-stack">
    <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-xs">
      <h2 class="wa-heading-m">Delivery</h2>
      <wa-icon id="about-delivery" name="circle-info" label="About delivery" tabindex="0"></wa-icon>
      <wa-tooltip for="about-delivery">An object is lost only if both ends were still logging when it was sent. One sent after a subscriber's log stopped is outside the window, not lost.</wa-tooltip>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
      <span class="wa-heading-xl">0 lost</span>
      <span class="wa-caption-m">of 203,416 objects the relay sent to four subscribers.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bar" role="img" aria-label="98.5% joined, 1.5% outside the window, none lost">
      <span class="success" style="flex-grow: 200402">98.5%</span>
      <span class="neutral" style="flex-grow: 3014"></span>
    </div>
    <ul class="rows">
      <li><span class="dot success"></span>Joined<span>200,402</span></li>
      <li><span class="dot neutral"></span>Outside the window<span>3,014</span></li>
      <li><span class="dot danger"></span>Lost<span>0</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="card-foot wa-split wa-caption-s">
      <span>Counted at both ends</span>
      <a href="connections/">Connections</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card wa-stack">
    <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-xs">
      <h2 class="wa-heading-m">Throughput</h2>
      <wa-icon id="about-throughput" name="circle-info" label="About throughput" tabindex="0"></wa-icon>
      <wa-tooltip for="about-throughput">Media payload bytes per second at the subscriber: no QUIC or MoQ framing, no retransmissions.</wa-tooltip>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
      <span class="wa-heading-xl">2.52 Mbit/s</span>
      <span class="wa-caption-m">video at sub-1, first minute. Audio is 128 kbit/s.</span>
    </div>
{% echart '150px', 'card' %}
{
  tooltip: { trigger: 'axis' },
  xAxis: {
    type: 'category',
    boundaryGap: false,
    axisLabel: { interval: 9 },
    data: Array.from({ length: 60 }, (_, i) => i),
  },
  // The data is kbit/s; the axis reads in Mbit/s, like the number above it.
  yAxis: { type: 'value', axisLabel: { formatter: (v) => v / 1000 } },
  series: [
    {
      name: 'video', type: 'line', showSymbol: false,
      data: Array.from({ length: 60 }, (_, i) =>
        Math.round(2400 + 300 * Math.sin(i / 4) + (i % 10 === 0 ? 900 : 0))),
    },
    {
      name: 'audio', type: 'line', showSymbol: false,
      data: Array.from({ length: 60 }, (_, i) => Math.round(128 + 4 * Math.sin(i))),
    },
  ],
}
{% endechart %}
    <div class="card-foot wa-split wa-caption-s">
      <span>Mbit/s. Blue: video.</span>
      <a href="throughput/">Throughput</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card wa-stack">
    <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-xs">
      <h2 class="wa-heading-m">Interarrival</h2>
      <wa-icon id="about-interarrival" name="circle-info" label="About interarrival" tabindex="0"></wa-icon>
      <wa-tooltip for="about-interarrival">Gap between an object arriving and the one before it on the same track. rtcstats calls this latency; webrtc-internals calls it jitter.</wa-tooltip>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
      <span class="wa-heading-xl">33.4 ms</span>
      <span class="wa-caption-m">median video gap at sub-1. sub-3 peaks at 108.3 ms.</span>
    </div>
{% echart '150px', 'card' %}
{
  tooltip: { trigger: 'axis' },
  xAxis: {
    type: 'category',
    boundaryGap: false,
    axisLabel: { interval: 99 },
    data: Array.from({ length: 600 }, (_, i) => i),
  },
  yAxis: { type: 'value' },
  series: [
    {
      // Drawn over sub-3, which it would otherwise sit under.
      name: 'sub-1', type: 'line', showSymbol: false, sampling: 'lttb', z: 3,
      data: Array.from({ length: 600 }, (_, i) =>
        +(33.3 + 2.5 * Math.sin(i / 3.1) + (i % 97 === 0 ? 40 : 0)).toFixed(1)),
    },
    {
      name: 'sub-3', type: 'line', showSymbol: false, sampling: 'lttb',
      data: Array.from({ length: 600 }, (_, i) =>
        +(33.3 + 5 * Math.sin(i / 1.7) + (i % 61 === 0 ? 70 : 0)).toFixed(1)),
    },
  ],
}
{% endechart %}
    <div class="card-foot wa-split wa-caption-s">
      <span>ms by object. Blue: sub-1.</span>
      <a href="interarrival/">Interarrival</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card wa-stack">
    <div class="wa-cluster wa-gap-xs">
      <h2 class="wa-heading-m">Clocks</h2>
      <wa-icon id="about-clocks" name="circle-info" label="About clocks" tabindex="0"></wa-icon>
      <wa-tooltip for="about-clocks">A negative hop is an object logged as arriving before it was sent. Only clock error produces one.</wa-tooltip>
    </div>
    <div class="wa-stack wa-gap-3xs">
      <span class="wa-heading-xl">0</span>
      <span class="wa-caption-m">negative hops in 300,996.</span>
    </div>
    <p class="wa-body-s">That rules out clock error larger than the transit time, and
    nothing finer. These captures hold reference time error under 10 µs because
    of how they were made, not because the data shows it.</p>
    <div class="card-foot wa-split wa-caption-s">
      <span>Both ends of every hop</span>
      <a href="connections/">Connections</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
